  67:			;X COMPILE,  xt --         append execution token
  68:			; I called this word ,XT before I discovered that
  69:			; it is defined in the ANSI standard as COMPILE,.
  70:			; On a DTC Forth this simply appends xt (like , )
  71:			; but on an STC Forth this must append 'CALL xt'.
