 801:			;C [']  --         find word & compile as literal
 802:			;   '  ['] LIT ,XT  , ; IMMEDIATE
 803:			; When encountered in a colon definition, the
 804:			; phrase  ['] xxx  will cause   LIT,xxt  to be
 805:			; compiled into the colon definition (where
 806:			; (where xxt is the execution token of word xxx).
 807:			; When the colon definition executes, xxt will
 808:			; be put on the stack.  (All xt's are one cell.)
 809:			;    immed BRACTICK,['],docolon
